id: ssl-confirm
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: Answer the SSL confirm by tap: https://self-signed.badssl.com/ raises the card's certificate dialog; Don't Trust takes the page away unloaded
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
kit: cavekit-device-build.md R4
needs: internet
calibrate bar
inject url https://self-signed.badssl.com/
expect dialog present 30
shoot ssl-dialog
chrome ssl-deny
expect dialog answered 8
